  Slug: hybrid-study
  DisplayName: Hybrid Study
  IconPath: icons/magic/symbols/question-stone-yellow.webp
  Description: 'Your extensive physical training and carefully chosen magic combine
    to form a unique and dangerous fighting style that''s more than the sum of its
    parts. You choose one field of hybrid study to represent your particular combination
    of skills. Your hybrid study gives you a special ability, usually tied to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Spellstrike]
    or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Arcane Cascade], and it determines
    your initial conflux spell. The hybrid studies presented in this book are as
    follows. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Aloof Firmament] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Inexorable
    Iron] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Laughing Shadow] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Sparkling
    Targe] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Starlit Span] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Twisting
    Tree] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Unfurling Brocade] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Resurgent
    Maelstrom]'
